OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA dry and bright day with
OL,6,Fvariable cloud and some hazy sunny
OL,7,Fspells. WInds will remain light and it
OL,8,Fwill become warm or very warm.
OL,9,
OL,10,CTonight:FA dry bright evening then a
OL,11,Fdry night with some clear spells,
OL,12,Fthough some patchy low cloud in the
OL,13,Feast.
OL,14,
OL,15,CWednesday:FA dry and bright day with
OL,16,Fsome good sunny spells. Becoming very
OL,17,Fwarm or hot, with light winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
