OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:
OL,6,FThursday will be sunny and hot. Friday
OL,7,Fand Saturday cloudier, mainly dry but
OL,8,Fthe odd shower, especially in west,
OL,9,Fless warm.
